{
 "_about": "The Editor page / Wraithguard contract: per link the request keys it needs (req) and may send (opt), and what it answers (ans: the keys of the object, \"list\", \"ok\"; alt: a second shape, answered to alt_example). Requests come from each handler's docstring (gui/editorlink.py, `body: {...}`); tests/test_editor_contract.py checks this file against them and runs the examples (`$tmp`, `$placed` and `$job` in one are filled in as it runs); the page tests (harness.js) check every request the page sends and every stand-in answer against it.",
 "links": {
